No Mapnik data where Mapnik is not built in

The settings turned Mapnik's data off only when libosmscout is there.
A build with neither (Pure Maps' vector tiles, Valhalla) offers the
custom profile only when Valhalla is missing too, and its default
downloads Mapnik's world data (700 MB) that it cannot use.

diff --git a/server/src/appsettings.cpp b/server/src/appsettings.cpp
index c7a4ec7..4292d97 100644
--- a/server/src/appsettings.cpp
+++ b/server/src/appsettings.cpp
@@ -235,7 +235,9 @@ void AppSettings::initDefaults()
       setValue(VALHALLA_MASTER_SETTINGS "use_valhalla", 1);
     }
 
-  if (!hasBackendMapnik() && hasBackendOsmScout())
+  // (also without libosmscout: the custom profile's default downloads
+  // Mapnik's data, of no use where Mapnik is not built in)
+  if (!hasBackendMapnik())
     {
       setValue(MAPMANAGER_SETTINGS "mapnik", 0);
       setValue(MAPNIKMASTER_SETTINGS "use_mapnik", 0);
